{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/6c726ca386925d70473422c243d71d5e.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/5400818dd9b889fe10620e2c4e88a492.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/2244daca41b52aa058e8e2ec4fd9ecba.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577070?t=1751365276","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577070?t=1751365276","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/3354d1be43f9c5387ddfba28e17e671d6c070f3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751365276","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/3354d1be43f9c5387ddfba28e17e671d6c070f3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751365276","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/6c726ca386925d70473422c243d71d5e.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/5400818dd9b889fe10620e2c4e88a492.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/2244daca41b52aa058e8e2ec4fd9ecba.webp?t=1751365276\" width=560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.poster.avif?t=1751365276\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.webm?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.mp4?t=1751365276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>","developers":["Ceiling Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/e810f99d1fd629f3ffe1ea823dacbdd763c75803/header.jpg?t=1751365276","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577070/905745034/1bd344f6e7d53318669645c519e552b519ecd064/1750470449/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748010083","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577070/905745034/1bd344f6e7d53318669645c519e552b519ecd064/1750470449/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748010083","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577070/905745034/1bd344f6e7d53318669645c519e552b519ecd064/1750470449/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748010083","id":257144289,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144289/movie480.mp4?t=1748010083","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144289/movie_max.mp4?t=1748010083"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144289/0246a32f2d608c061ac4a2abdcb95a391a167249/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748010083","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144289/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748010083","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144289/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748010083"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577070/1559710384/724feb17b61bc88af317b106641141a83a636e68/1750470455